DEITY ASSIGNMENT — DM/STAFF ADMIN (PRIVATE PLAYTEST)
Syntax:
  *deity list
  *deity <player>
  *deity <player> <1-16>
  *deity <player> 0

List valid slots, inspect allegiance, assign a deity, or clear allegiance.
Example: *deity Playername 3
Requires native DM class and staff administrator authority. Target must
be an existing saved character (online or offline). Changes are audited
and recorded in the protected deity database. Invalid or corrupt records
fail closed. Names of deities and favor rewards are not yet configured.
See also: help deity | help corpse
